From 0df53e567bf37dd54c2a51797b9bf08c893d28c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:47:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] freedreno/xenos: index DMA size in 16-bit words, no
 8-bit indices, resolve endian 3 for byte-reversed formats

- VGT_DMA_SIZE counts 16-bit words on Xenos (libxenon: count << indextype); bytes made
  dEQP buffer.write cases wedge the GPU.
- VGT_DRAW_INITIATOR has a one-bit index size on Xenos: report R8_UINT index buffers
  unsupported so u_vbuf rewrites them.
- Resolve endian 3 reverses dword bytes (2 swaps halves), measured with dEQP color_clear
  on an A8R8G8B8 pbuffer across all endian/swap combinations; XENOS_RESOLVE_<fmt>=<e><s>
  override for experiments.
- GLES on big-endian accepts GL_BGRA + UNSIGNED_INT_8_8_8_8_REV (glamor).
- XENOS_DEBUG prints formats.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QFJdrUq9L8NDS5PyGFCsG9
Generated-by: LLM
